  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;then the local maximum value of the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>e</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
